\t\t<p>\u00a0 When looking for business sustainability it is important to analyze factors such as price, quality and delivery times, which are crucial in the supply chain and can be optimized to be more environmentally friendly in terms of reducing CO2 emissions, less polluting fuels, delivery management, among others that, in addition to making the company more sustainable, help reduce costs and optimize work.<br \/>Using a <span style=\"color: #808080;\"><a style=\"color: #808080;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/supply-chain-management-canada\/\">Canada supply chain management system<\/a><\/span> helps you gain competitive advantage in an increasingly changing market, where innovation is key to staying current. Today&#8217;s companies, facing the crisis scenario due to COVID-19, need to reduce the latent risk that the supply chain will be interrupted by changes in environmental, hygiene and safety regulations, anticipating and implementing the corresponding measures of quickly and efficiently.<br \/>More and more companies working in the logistics, transport and supply sector understand that sustainability is no longer an isolated issue for corporate responsibility, but has become a need to which they can respond with the use of the management system <strong><span style=\"color: #808080;\"><a style=\"color: #808080;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/sap-canada\/\">SAP Canada<\/a><\/span>.<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a72194b\" data-id=\"a72194b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a84af4e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"a84af4e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-contain